{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_63f3ddf5690dbef14b3d7c82", "claim_ids": ["claim_34c4b53fb043f3928b862bea", "claim_555e4864663b741d973c4612"], "query_ids": ["q_113"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_34c4b53fb043f3928b862bea", "quote": "Lithium-ion non-EV batteries – January 1, 2026, increase from 7.5% to 25%", "url": "https://www.millercanfield.com/resources-USTR-Starts-New-Section-301-Tariffs.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "affected_product": "Lithium-ion non-EV batteries", "effective_date": "January 1, 2026"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_555e4864663b741d973c4612", "quote": "Lithium-ion non-electrical vehicle batteries | 25% | January 1, 2026 | 7.5%", "url": "https://www.whitecase.com/insight-alert/united-states-finalizes-section-301-tariff-increases-imports-china", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"affected_product": "Lithium-ion non-electrical vehicle batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "January 1, 2026"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_74cfbeb534300fd27337996f", "claim_ids": ["claim_07f0f96cbd33759d32be38c6", "claim_bbe5745eacc1459ff4113e55"], "query_ids": ["q_114"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_07f0f96cbd33759d32be38c6", "quote": "Lithium-ion EV batteries – August 1, 2024, increase from 7.5% to 25%", "url": "https://www.millercanfield.com/resources-USTR-Starts-New-Section-301-Tariffs.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"affected_product": "Lithium-ion EV batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "August 1, 2024"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_bbe5745eacc1459ff4113e55", "quote": "Lithium-ion EV batteries | 7.5% | 25% | Sep 27, 2024", "url": "https://ustariffrates.com/section-301-tariffs", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "affected_product": "Lithium-ion EV batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "Sep 27, 2024"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_1164e44fa06747e0aae81206", "claim_ids": ["claim_325bf2720141d0cb54a84ebf", "claim_91e89cfd4f29beb08191c2d9"], "query_ids": ["q_115"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_325bf2720141d0cb54a84ebf", "quote": "As such, the applicable subheading for the lithium-ion battery pouch cell, part number SK E603, will be 8507.90.8000, HTSUS, which provides for “Electric storage batteries, including separators therefor, whether or not rectangular (including square); parts thereof: Parts: Other.” The rate of duty will be 3.4 percent ad valorem.", "url": "https://www.customsmobile.com/rulings/docview?doc_id=NY+N335323&highlight=8507.60.0010%2A", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"hts_code": "8507.90.8000", "duty_rate": "3.4 percent ad valorem"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_91e89cfd4f29beb08191c2d9", "quote": "Base HS Code: 8507.60.00 – Lithium-ion batteries Typical Import Duty (MFN): ~3.4% ad valorem", "url": "https://www.szaspower.com/industry-news/lithium-ion-battery-hs-code-guide.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "MFN", "duty_rate": "~3.4% ad valorem"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_0a1ec76a03691d5698ad5f70", "claim_ids": ["claim_2f9e3100f3ea4817f3975588", "claim_956c59f7d0d4a7a792676360"], "query_ids": ["q_116"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_2f9e3100f3ea4817f3975588", "quote": "And US companies now have to pay a 15% tax on those batteries, where previously they didn't.", "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/electricvehicles/comments/1mp1jzn/exclusive_us_ev_battery_imports_from_korea_top", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "US companies", "duty_rate": "15%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_956c59f7d0d4a7a792676360", "quote": "South Korea and Japan, as major battery manufacturers, now sit in the forced-labor tariff's 10% tier", "url": "https://www.tariffstool.com/tariffs-on-energy-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"country_of_origin": "South Korea", "duty_rate": "10%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_72172c4b2597fe985bb22ab7", "claim_ids": ["claim_2f9e3100f3ea4817f3975588", "claim_aef983ee3922e0eb247d06bb"], "query_ids": ["q_116"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_2f9e3100f3ea4817f3975588", "quote": "And US companies now have to pay a 15% tax on those batteries, where previously they didn't.", "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/electricvehicles/comments/1mp1jzn/exclusive_us_ev_battery_imports_from_korea_top", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "US companies", "duty_rate": "15%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_aef983ee3922e0eb247d06bb", "quote": "South Korean batteries now face only the 10% forced-labor tariff on top of any base duty — a marked improvement from their former IEEPA reciprocal rate", "url": "https://www.tariffstool.com/tariffs-on-energy-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "10%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_906b958cbd422c9b50a57dd2", "claim_ids": ["claim_2df978fd731f273bd1be9638", "claim_db53444c1ddda362bf5bb1d4"], "query_ids": ["q_116"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_2df978fd731f273bd1be9638", "quote": "Yes, EV battery cells and packs from China face Section 301 tariffs of 25% on top of the base 3.4% duty. This has accelerated battery production shifts to South Korea, Japan, and domestic US facilities.", "url": "https://ustariffrates.com/import/batteries/from/south-korea", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301 tariffs", "duty_rate": "25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_db53444c1ddda362bf5bb1d4", "quote": "Batteries imported from South Korea are subject to the standard MFN base duty rate, plus Section 232 steel screening, Section 232 aluminum screening tariff overlays.", "url": "https://ustariffrates.com/import/batteries/from/south-korea", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 steel screening, Section 232 aluminum screening"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_30e6a2f49b38e03d78cd18f8", "claim_ids": ["claim_448d77df58ac2e037cecbcbf", "claim_c252d650293f8ac18eb9d015"], "query_ids": ["q_117"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_448d77df58ac2e037cecbcbf", "quote": "At the beginning of 2025, lithium-ion cells from China, specifically for energy storage systems (ESS), faced a 64.9% cumulative tariff rate.", "url": "https://acculonenergy.com/the-tariff-tangle-china-trade-the-battery-industry-in-2025", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "64.9%", "effective_date": "beginning of 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_c252d650293f8ac18eb9d015", "quote": "Lithium-ion batteries are classified under HTS 8507.60 with a base duty rate of 3.4%. Section 301 tariffs on Chinese-origin lithium-ion batteries add 25%, bringing the effective rate to 28.4% for Chinese imports.", "url": "https://ustariffrates.com/products/batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "duty_rate": "28.4%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_0e97062777bb72b57e4da27f", "claim_ids": ["claim_c252d650293f8ac18eb9d015", "claim_d19f508ad3e769aa45b372fc"], "query_ids": ["q_117"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_c252d650293f8ac18eb9d015", "quote": "Lithium-ion batteries are classified under HTS 8507.60 with a base duty rate of 3.4%. Section 301 tariffs on Chinese-origin lithium-ion batteries add 25%, bringing the effective rate to 28.4% for Chinese imports.", "url": "https://ustariffrates.com/products/batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "duty_rate": "28.4%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_d19f508ad3e769aa45b372fc", "quote": "For EV lithium-ion batteries, the combined tariff rate has increased from 7.5% to 58% in 2025.", "url": "https://acculonenergy.com/the-tariff-tangle-china-trade-the-battery-industry-in-2025", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "58%", "effective_date": "2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_4d698d35c1282dc6090b3fff", "claim_ids": ["claim_1ff954c8f70d7307cac143c2", "claim_ea670334fd653593a9167e08"], "query_ids": ["q_117"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_1ff954c8f70d7307cac143c2", "quote": "Covered Chinese lithium-ion non-EV batteries are subject to a 25% legacy Section 301 duty, and a new 12.5% Forced-Labor Section 301 duty generally applies to products of China entered on or after July 24, 2026", "url": "https://www.large-battery.com/blog/us-tariff-on-chinese-lithium-ion-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "July 24, 2026"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ea670334fd653593a9167e08", "quote": "The additional Section 301 rate is 25% for covered Chinese lithium-ion non-EV batteries in 2026.", "url": "https://www.large-battery.com/blog/us-tariff-on-chinese-lithium-ion-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_0e63dda33f29c6ee337ac3b4", "claim_ids": ["claim_34151d0d22bacb19e43b4c38", "claim_f88d3930b672fc8824471568"], "query_ids": ["q_119"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_34151d0d22bacb19e43b4c38", "quote": "CBP has previously held that the assembly of battery cells into battery packs does not result in a substantial transformation", "url": "https://www.customsmobile.com/rulings/docview?doc_id=HQ+H316545&highlight=HQ+H316545", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "CBP"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_f88d3930b672fc8824471568", "quote": "CBP has previously held that assembling battery cells into battery packs does not characterize substantial transformation of the battery cells because the fundamental character of the cells is not altered simply by being placed together in plastic casing.", "url": "https://www.cmtradelaw.com/2023/01/customs-ruling-of-the-week-country-of-origin-of-battery-modules-and-battery-packs-and-the-applicability-of-certain-trade-remedies-under-section-301", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}]}

